01:14:06.981 --> 01:14:08.397
and then I delete the 2.

01:14:08.564 --> 01:14:10.231
I update my pointer to point at the 4,

01:14:10.314 --> 01:14:11.606
then I delete the 3,

01:14:11.814 --> 01:14:13.022
and then I delete the 4.

01:14:13.189 --> 01:14:15.647
So there's a bit of trickery involved

01:14:15.814 --> 01:14:18.356
in making sure you don't orphan things

01:14:18.647 --> 01:14:19.147
step

01:14:19.231 --> 01:14:19.856
by step.

